    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with unique mechanics and themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tutorial (Grass)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the starting area, which contains simple toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regions (Ruins)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Offsets (Snow)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toros (Fall)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters in Toroban are called <i>toros</i>. There can be multiple toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combined (Desert)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the mechanics combine together in this area. Completely new kinds of puzzles emerge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced (Cosmic)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A secret mechanic is revealed, as well as more advanced overworld puzzles, and more advanced sub-puzzles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with unique mechanics and themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tutorial (Grass)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the starting area, which contains simple toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regions (Ruins)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Offsets (Snow)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toros (Fall)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters in Toroban are called <i>toros</i>. There can be multiple toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combined (Desert)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the mechanics combine together in this area. Completely new kinds of puzzles emerge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Advanced (Cosmic)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A secret mechanic is revealed, as well as more advanced overworld puzzles, and more advanced sub-puzzles.</p>",
